sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Shopper
    participant SF as storefront (BFF)
    participant RS as redis-session
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant GW as api-gateway
    U->>SF: GET /login?returnTo=/checkout
    SF->>RS: store state, nonce, PKCE verifier (5 min)
    SF-->>U: 302 to Keycloak (code, PKCE S256, state, nonce)
    U->>KC: sign in (password or passkey)
    KC-->>U: 302 /auth/callback?code&state
    U->>SF: GET /auth/callback
    SF->>KC: code + verifier + client secret (back channel)
    KC-->>SF: ID, access, refresh tokens
    SF->>RS: new session id → encrypted tokens, user, roles
    SF->>GW: POST /cart/merge {guestId} with Bearer token
    SF-->>U: 302 returnTo, Set-Cookie __Host-sid (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax)
